    {
      "id": "t_note_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 280.8,
      "height": 287.3,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 51453,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793429136320,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Idempotency:\n   UNIQUE (account_id, external_id)\n   prevents duplicate transaction\n   extraction at DB level.\n\n2. Range Query Acceleration:\n   Composite Index on\n   (user_id, created_at) makes\n   monthly spending aggregation\n   blazing fast (O(log N + K)).\n\n3. High-Precision Decimals:\n   Amounts stored as TEXT to prevent\n   IEEE 754 float rounding errors.\n\n4. Zero Plaintext Credentials:\n   AES-256 encrypted passwords.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Idempotency:\n   UNIQUE (account_id, external_id)\n   prevents duplicate transaction\n   extraction at DB level.\n\n2. Range Query Acceleration:\n   Composite Index on\n   (user_id, created_at) makes\n   monthly spending aggregation\n   blazing fast (O(log N + K)).\n\n3. High-Precision Decimals:\n   Amounts stored as TEXT to prevent\n   IEEE 754 float rounding errors.\n\n4. Zero Plaintext Credentials:\n   AES-256 encrypted passwords.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
